# {{name}}

A Pitwall tile: Rust built to a WebAssembly component (`wasm32-wasip2`) that
Pitwall runs in a sandbox and draws in its own theme.

{{skill_note}}

- Build, check and load it into the running Pitwall: `pitwall extension dev`
- Check it without building: `pitwall extension check .`
- Test it: `cargo test` (the tests build `tile.wasm` and run it in Pitwall's
  tile runtime)
